
- assymm.C: make A1 plot for one energy setting, produce xxx_collection.txt
- print_asymm.C: print xxx_asymm_table.txt for other analysis

- combine_asymm.C: combine A1 from different energy settings (This is the version for presentation/paper/documents/etc.). Use xxx_collection.txt as input.
- per_Qbin_assym.C: draw A1 and g1 vs x for each Q2 bin. Use xxx_collection.txt as input.

## Special setting
- assymm_ECCEbins.C: make A1 plot for one energy setting with ECCE binning, produce xxx_ecce_bins.txt